module-description = Answers a link to a message of the server, or to a post on X, with a preview of it.
config-linkexpand-message_links = Quote the message that a link to a message of this server leads to.
config-linkexpand-x_links = Show the text, the pictures and the counts of a link to a post on X.
config-linkexpand-replied_post = Show the post that a post on X replies to, before it.
config-linkexpand-quoted_post = Show the post that a post on X quotes, after it.
config-linkexpand-translate_button = A button that translates a post on X.
config-linkexpand-hide_original = Hide the preview Discord made of a link to a post on X, which the answer repeats. The bot needs the permission to manage messages.
config-linkexpand-layout = How a post that replies to or quotes another is shown: embeds in one message, or a message for each post, each answering the one before.
config-linkexpand-auto_translate = Put the post in the language of the server under it, when it is in another one.
linkexpand-translated = 🌐 Translation
linkexpand-source = Source
linkexpand-open = Open on X
linkexpand-delete = Delete
linkexpand-translate = Translate
linkexpand-delete-reason = The one who posted the link took the preview away
linkexpand-delete-gone = That message was already deleted.
linkexpand-delete-forbidden = The bot may not delete that message here.
linkexpand-delete-failed = The answer could not be deleted just now. Try again in a moment.
linkexpand-replied-to = ↩ Original post (this replies to it)
linkexpand-quoted = 💬 Quoted post
linkexpand-reposted-by = 🔁 Repost by
linkexpand-translate-failed = That could not be translated just now. Try again in a moment.
